  "excerpts": "Proclamation 10962 of July 30, 2025 \n Adjusting Imports of <span class=\"match\">Copper</span> Into the United States \n \n A Proclamation \n 1. On June 30, 2025, the Secretary of Commerce (Secretary) transmitted to me a report on his investigation into the effects of imports of <span class=\"match\">copper</span> in all forms (<span class=\"match\">copper</span>), including <span class=\"match\">copper</span> ores, <span class=\"match\">copper</span> concentrates, refined <span class=\"match\">copper</span>, <span class=\"match\">copper</span> alloys, scrap <span class=\"match\">copper</span>, and derivative products, on the national security of the United States under section 232 of the Trade Expansion Act of 1962, as amended, 19 U.S.C. 1862 (section 232). Based on the facts",
